{"source_id":"W402","platform":"RSS","author":"AUTOMATON RSS","account_type":"メディア","text":"PS5/PS4向け「PS Plusフリープレイ」7月で、人気FPS『Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III』配布へ。定価9800円のゲームがフリプ入り\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://automaton-media.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260702-452953-header2.jpg\" width=\"1600\" /></p>PlayStation Plus加入者向けの7月のフリープレイでは、『Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III』など3作品がラインナップされている。","url":"https://automaton-media.com/articles/newsjp/20260702-452953/","timestamp":"2026-07-02T03:01:49Z","extra":{"source_priority":"high","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
